  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From Joule&#39;s law,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mi>RJ</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>cal</mi></math><br /><br />Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is potential difference, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>&nbsp;is the time and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;is the resistance.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>HJ</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>constant</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>kt</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>and</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>kt</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kt</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>kt</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>kt</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></math>&nbsp;minutes",
